  "priorExpiration": "2008-03-12",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mvi 205.02 Filing Fee. Pursuant to RSA 357-C:12, VIII (b), a filing fee of $1,500 shall be paid to the New Hampshire motor vehicle industry board fund when a party files a protest under RSA 357-C.\n\nSource. #6651, eff 12-10-97; ss by #6980, eff 4-21-99, EXPIRED: 4-21-07\n\nNew. #8978, INTERIM, eff 9-14-07, EXPIRES: 3-12-08; ss by #9043-A, eff 11-29-07",
